  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline O-TORO SNAP Tour Flex is a firm, round co-polyester designed to add control, stability and tension hold to the O-TORO family. Its smooth round geometry provides a clean, predictable response and low-friction string movement, while the Tour Flex construction increases stringbed stability for advanced players with fast swing speeds. O-TORO SNAP can be used as a full-bed control string or as a low-friction cross in shaped Toroline hybrids.",

    "zh": "Toroline O-TORO SNAP Tour Flex 是 O-TORO 系列中的偏硬圆形共聚酯球线，核心定位是提升控制、稳定以及保磅表现。圆形光滑结构带来干净、可预测的击球反馈和低摩擦 Snapback，而 Tour Flex 偏硬调校则进一步强化高速挥拍下的线床稳定性。它既可以整床使用，也非常适合作为 O-TORO、VAMOS 或 O-TORO TOUR 等异形主线的低摩擦横线。"
  },

